Creates the exit handler on the first call of `onExit`, `load` or `unload` instead of on import.
Creating it defines a property on `globalThis`, and importing `unutils/server` must not change
globals: the package is bundled for `writeJsonFile` (through `write-file-atomic`), and our bundled
modules evaluate it as soon as they are imported.

